<title>USA: NationsBank files for $1.031 bln note issue.</title>
<headline>NationsBank files for $1.031 bln note issue.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>NationsBank Corp said on Thursday it filed a shelf registration with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission to sell up to $1.031 billion in junior subordinated notes.</p>
</text>
